Package: mtnardl
Type: Package
Title: Bootstrap Multiple Threshold Nonlinear ARDL
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Muhammad", "Alkhalaf", email = "muhammedalkhalaf@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-2677-9246"))
Description: Implements the Multiple Threshold Nonlinear ARDL (MTNARDL) model
    following Pal and Mitra (2016) <doi:10.1016/j.econmod.2015.09.058>.
    Regressors are decomposed into regime-specific partial sums based on
    quantile or custom cut-point partitions. Cointegration is assessed using
    the PSS bounds test of Pesaran, Shin and Smith (2001)
    <doi:10.1002/jae.616>. An optional bootstrap variant provides
    finite-sample critical values following McNown, Sam and Goh (2018)
    <doi:10.1111/obes.12222>. Lag orders are selected automatically by AIC
    or BIC. Dynamic multipliers per regime are reported.
